\title{Reliability protocol and failure taxonomy}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{evaluation}
\p{A reliability protocol binds an evaluation to its durable state, replay
inputs, and audit record. Execution and grading failures can invalidate a
measurement even when the reported benchmark score improves.}
